Author = {Vijayakrishnan, Jayaram and Qian, Maoxiang and Studd, James B. and Yang,
   Wenjian and Kinnersley, Ben and Law, Philip J. and Broderick, Peter and
   Raetz, Elizabeth A. and Allan, James and Pui, Ching-Hon and Vora, Ajay
   and Evans, William E. and Moorman, Anthony and Yeoh, Allen and Yang,
   Wentao and Li, Chunliang and Bartram, Claus R. and Mullighan, Charles G.
